#: ../../library/profile.rst:324
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The resulting profiler will then call ``your_time_func``. Depending on "
"whether you are using :class:`profile.Profile` "
"or :class:`profiling.tracing.Profile`, ``your_time_func``'s return value "
